; Relax all XYU motors before manual movement test (in case of restart without homing)
M84 XYU
G4 S1

M564 H0

M291 R"Move Tools by Hand Test" P"Manually move both tool heads along X, Y, and U axes.<br><br>Check that movement is smooth and without binding.<br><br>Pay attention to any unusual resistance or sounds." S4 K{"Start Test","Skip","Cancel"}
if input == 1
    M99
elif input == 2
    abort "Test cancelled by user"

M291 R"Move XYU Axes Manually" P"Manually move both tool heads by hand.<br>Test all axes: X (left tool), U (right tool), and Y (gantry)." S3 X1 Y1 U1

M291 R"Confirm Tool Movement" P"Confirm that all tool movements were smooth without binding or unusual resistance." S4 K{"Movement Smooth","Cancel"}
if input == 1
    abort "Test cancelled by user"

M302 P0
M564 H1

M291 R"Z - Motor Connection Test" P"Each motor will move in sequence: Left, Right, Rear" S4 K{"Test","Skip","Cancel"}
if input == 1
    M99
elif input == 2
    abort "Test cancelled by user"


M564 H0

M913 Z75 ; Reduce Z-axis current to 75% for safe motor testing

; Move Left lead screw
M584 Z1.2     ; define driver mapping

G91               ; set to relative positioning
G1 F18000 Z10    ; move 10mm down
G1 F18000 Z-20     ; move 20mm up
G1 F18000 Z10    ; move 10mm down back to original position
G90               ; set to absolute positioning

M400

; Move Right lead screw
M584 Z1.0     ; define driver mapping

G91               ; set to relative positioning
G1 F18000 Z10    ; move 10mm down
G1 F18000 Z-20     ; move 20mm up
G1 F18000 Z10    ; move 10mm down back to original position
G90               ; set to absolute positioning

M400

; Move Rear lead screw
M584 Z1.1     ; define driver mapping

G91               ; set to relative positioning
G1 F18000 Z10    ; move 10mm down
G1 F18000 Z-20     ; move 20mm up
G1 F18000 Z10    ; move 10mm down back to original position
G90               ; set to absolute positioning

M400
M584 Z1.0:1.1:1.2 ; restore original driver mapping

M913 Z100 ; Reset Z-axis current to 100%

M564 H1
